  "mod": {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 1884,
      "hub_id": 2546,
      "guid": "com.lacyway.ch",
      "name": "Continuous Healing",
      "slug": "continuous-healing",
      "teaser": "Tired of having to heal every limb one by one? Now you can heal them all in one go until done or manually cancelled!",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2546.png",
      "downloads": 119626,
      "favourites_count": 161,
      "description": "<h3><strong>What does the mod do?</strong></h3>\n<p>With <strong>Continuous Healing</strong> you can click the healing button once and it will continue healing all limbs until you reach 100%, removing the need to do it for every limb and waiting for the animations to bring up your weapon. The delay that is normally 2 seconds is removed between each limb, speeding up healing slightly as well. If the med kit runs out it will stop as per usual. Tested and working with Fika.</p>\n<p>I <em><strong>highly recommend</strong></em> using this with <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1779-healing-autocancel\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Healing Autocancel</a>!</p>\n<h3><strong>Incompatible mods</strong></h3>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/260-bettermeds-revised/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Better Meds Revised</a></p>\n<h3><strong>Known issues</strong></h3>\n<p>Healing a destroyed limb with a <strong>CMS</strong> or <strong>Surv12 kit</strong> will not play the animation on the second limb due to how the animations work for these items. You will still heal them at a slightly faster rate, just wait until your weapon appears and it’s done. Looking for an elegant fix if possible down the line.</p>\n<p>If you have any issues with the mod, be thorough in your report or you will be ignored. Thanks!</p>\n<p>You can support me on Ko-Fi</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/lacyway\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click</a></p>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1884/continuous-healing",
      "fika_compatibility": true,
